{"id":181,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"The light from its tail can be seen from space. This is why you can always tell exactly where it is, which is why it usually keeps the light off."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Ampharos gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used the light of this Pokémon to send signals back and forth with others far away."},{"games":["Y","X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"The tail’s tip shines brightly and can be seen from far away. It acts as a beacon for lost people."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The tip of its tail shines so brightly it can be used to send sea-navigation beacons to distant foreign shores."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tail’s light."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"The bright light on its tail can be seen far away. It has been treasured since ancient times as a beacon."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used its light to send signals back and forth with others far away."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"When it gets dark, the light from its bright, shiny tail can be seen from far away on the ocean's surface."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Static","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is charged with static electricity and may paralyze attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Plus","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Sp. Atk stat of the Pokémon if an ally with the Plus or Minus Ability is also in battle."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Yellow","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":179,"name":"Mareep","condition":null,"children":[{"id":180,"name":"Flaaffy","condition":"Lv. 15","children":[{"id":181,"name":"Ampharos","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,9],[1,7],[1,33],[1,45],[1,84],[1,86],[1,192],[1,406],[1,602],[11,178],[16,268],[20,36],[25,486],[29,109],[35,408],[40,435],[46,538],[51,605],[57,113],[62,87]],"machine":[97,34,784,280,523,268,451,109,605,91,38,913,406,525,598,604,486,527,283,203,263,7,374,411,264,416,270,63,8,113,67,800,200,408,182,240,115,156,46,214,707,164,241,916,129,36,851,87,9,86,85,885,521,528],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me4-90","name":"Ampharos","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"90","artist":"saino misaki","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-90/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-90/large"},{"id":"me4-29","name":"Ampharos","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Rare","number":"29","artist":"CHORISO","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-29/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-29/large"},{"id":"sv10-74","name":"Team Rocket's Ampharos","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"74","artist":null,"img":"sv10/74"},{"id":"svp-16","name":"Ampharos ex","set":"Scarlet & Violet Black Star Promos","date":"2023-01-01","rarity":"Promo","number":"16","artist":"PLANETA Tsuji","img":"svp/16"},{"id":"svp-109","name":"Ampharos","set":"Scarlet & Violet Black Star Promos","date":"2023-01-01","rarity":"Promo","number":"109","artist":"GIDORA","img":"svp/109"},{"id":"swsh7-56","name":"Ampharos","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"2021-08-27","rarity":"Rare","number":"56","artist":"Saya Tsuruta","img":"swsh7/56"},{"id":"swsh6-49","name":"Ampharos","set":"Chilling Reign","date":"2021-06-18","rarity":"Rare","number":"49","artist":"Megumi Mizutani","img":"swsh6/49"},{"id":"swsh4-49","name":"Ampharos V","set":"V